Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.

Context: None

Question: Select the best translation into predicate logic. Some firefighters rescue victims from danger. (Dx: x is danger; Fx: x is a firefighter; Vx: x is a victim; Rxyz: x rescues y from z)

Options: 
A. (∃x){{Fx • (∀y)[Dy ⊃ (∃z)(Vz • Rxyz)]}}
B. (∃x){{Fx • (∃y)[Vy • (∃z)(Dz • Rxyz)]}}
C. (∃x){{Fx • (∃y)(∃z)[(Vy • Dz) • Rxzy]}}
D. (∀x){{Fx ⊃ (∃y)[Vy . (∃z)(Dz • Rxyz)]}}

Provide the correct letter choice in \boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.
